graph TD
    Internet((Internet)) --> AGW[App Gateway WAF v2]
    Admin((Admin User)) --> Bastion[Azure Bastion]
    
    subgraph Hub VNet
        AGW
        Bastion
        LAW[Log Analytics]
        KV[Key Vault]
        RSV[Recovery Services Vault]
    end
    
    subgraph Spoke VNets
        VM_L[Linux VM]
        VM_W[Windows VM]
    end
    
    AGW -->|HTTP/S| VM_L
    AGW -->|HTTP/S| VM_W
    Bastion -->|SSH| VM_L
    Bastion -->|RDP| VM_W
    
    VM_L -.->|Logs| LAW
    VM_W -.->|Logs| LAW
    VM_L -.->|Backup| RSV
    VM_W -.->|Backup| RSV
